{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05242","headline":"度涂山 · 寇泚","name":"度涂山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小年弄文墨，不识戎旅难。\n一朝事鞞鼓，策马度涂山。\n涂山横地轴，万里留荒服。\n悠悠征斾远，騑骖一何速。\n流月挥金戈，惊风折寒木。\n行闻汉飞将，还向臯兰宿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寇泚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}